                        "sense_id": "a4be9489-5e8f-3d91-adaf-45084f2090fd",
                        "entry_id": "c75ea465-ff6a-3917-999b-408e9ecde64e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Stepmother."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US",
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a316a97-7544-407b-8d0a-e4d7399717bb",
                                "sense_id": "a4be9489-5e8f-3d91-adaf-45084f2090fd",
                                "text": "The Papster, my stepmom, her sister Angela the psychoanalyst, and Angela's husband Eric the kazillionaire were strolling along the canal."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96cd5fd6-3175-4f6a-b640-81c5cc48eb3d",
                                "sense_id": "a4be9489-5e8f-3d91-adaf-45084f2090fd",
                                "text": "Susan Sasse of Chesapeake City, Md., vice president of the International Stepfamily Association, a nonprofit group, said: \"What I hear from new stepmoms all the time, especially with older kids, is, 'They just hate me. They don't want to give me a chance. They think I'm taking their dad.'\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "364ad963-529a-44d3-8c1e-0c2946f7521a",
                                "sense_id": "a4be9489-5e8f-3d91-adaf-45084f2090fd",
                                "text": "Now that I’m a stepmom legally, I would argue that it’s a wonderful role: You learn how to parent with your partner before the stress of a newborn comes into the mix."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a8989f25-f2c1-4f47-b695-f2a3bc72e2a8",
                                "sense_id": "a4be9489-5e8f-3d91-adaf-45084f2090fd",
                                "text": "A few years later when Doug and I got married, Cole, Ella, and I agreed that we didn’t like the term “stepmom.” Instead they came up with the name “Momala.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
